<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1473744236"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1527990971"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Alright (feat. Russell Dickerson)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Clara Mae / Russell Dickerson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Alright (feat. Russell Dickerson)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:41.085"><div begin="00:07.166" end="02:37.281"><p begin="00:07.166" end="00:10.903" itunes:key="L1">Still tryna lose the thought of your face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我竭尽全力 让自己别去想你</span></p><p begin="00:11.351" end="00:13.521" itunes:key="L2">But I think about you all the time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我一直思念着你</span></p><p begin="00:13.832" end="00:17.613" itunes:key="L3">I know we said we'd give each other space<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我们说过要给彼此空间</span></p><p begin="00:17.879" end="00:19.650" itunes:key="L4">Just need to know you're alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只需要知道你一切安好</span></p><p begin="00:19.660" end="00:23.001" itunes:key="L5">Heard from your mom, you got some new tattoos<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从你妈妈那里得知</span></p><p begin="00:23.011" end="00:25.886" itunes:key="L6">Moved out of state<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你离开了这里</span></p><p begin="00:26.182" end="00:29.419" itunes:key="L7">Don't mean no pressure, just need to make sure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并不想给你压力</span></p><p begin="00:29.429" end="00:32.265" itunes:key="L8">That you're okay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你安然无恙</span></p><p begin="00:32.311" end="00:35.841" itunes:key="L9">Although feelings faded<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我们的感情不复存在</span></p><p begin="00:36.003" end="00:38.889" itunes:key="L10">We're not strangers<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我们不是陌生人</span></p><p begin="00:38.899" end="00:42.149" itunes:key="L11">Just because we're not friends doesn't mean I don't care<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是因为我们不是朋友</span></p><p begin="00:42.159" end="00:44.930" itunes:key="L12">Are you alright, alright?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否安好</span></p><p begin="00:45.391" end="00:48.711" itunes:key="L13">Don't know how to just stop, used to love you too much<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知如何放下这份眷恋</span></p><p begin="00:48.721" end="00:51.379" itunes:key="L14">Are you alright, alright?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否安好</span></p><p begin="00:51.733" end="00:54.177" itunes:key="L15">'Cause I've been losing sleep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我总是辗转反侧 难以入眠</span></p><p begin="00:54.420" end="00:57.771" itunes:key="L16">Wondering if you're good, so please<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知道你过得好不好 所以 拜托你</span></p><p begin="00:58.100" end="01:01.698" itunes:key="L17">Just pick your phone up, let me know and I'll stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你拿起手机联系我</span></p><p begin="01:01.708" end="01:05.836" itunes:key="L18">Are you alright? Just say you're all alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否安好</span></p><p begin="01:05.846" end="01:09.404" itunes:key="L19">Think I needed space, some time alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以为我需要一些独处的时间</span></p><p begin="01:10.099" end="01:12.362" itunes:key="L20">Really just to get my head straight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想让我清醒一下</span></p><p begin="01:12.474" end="01:15.915" itunes:key="L21">So I saw the world 'til I went broke<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我看着这世界 直到我伤心欲绝</span></p><p begin="01:16.675" end="01:18.443" itunes:key="L22">And tried to not look at my phone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让自己别一直盯着手机</span></p><p begin="01:18.453" end="01:22.382" itunes:key="L23">Heard from my mom, you called her and dad to ask<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从我妈妈那里得知</span></p><p begin="01:22.392" end="01:24.472" itunes:key="L24">How I've been<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的近况</span></p><p begin="01:24.791" end="01:28.190" itunes:key="L25">But I'm still not ready, too hurt and angry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我还未做好准备</span></p><p begin="01:28.200" end="01:30.990" itunes:key="L26">To let you in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿让你走进我心底</span></p><p begin="01:31.000" end="01:34.631" itunes:key="L27">Although feelings faded<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我们的感情不复存在</span></p><p begin="01:34.788" end="01:37.690" itunes:key="L28">We're not strangers<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我们不是陌生人</span></p><p begin="01:37.700" end="01:40.929" itunes:key="L29">Just because we're not friends doesn't mean I don't care<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是因为我们不是朋友</span></p><p begin="01:40.939" end="01:43.710" itunes:key="L30">Are you alright, alright?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否安好</span></p><p begin="01:44.200" end="01:47.436" itunes:key="L31">Don't know how to just stop, used to love you too much<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知如何放下这份眷恋</span></p><p begin="01:47.446" end="01:50.139" itunes:key="L32">Are you alright, alright?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否安好</span></p><p begin="01:50.500" end="01:53.047" itunes:key="L33">'Cause I've been losing sleep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我总是辗转反侧 难以入眠</span></p><p begin="01:53.140" end="01:56.577" itunes:key="L34">Wondering if you're good, so please<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知道你过得好不好 所以 拜托你</span></p><p begin="01:56.840" end="02:00.518" itunes:key="L35">Just pick your phone up, let me know and I'll stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你拿起手机联系我</span></p><p begin="02:00.528" end="02:04.936" itunes:key="L36">Are you alright? Just say you're all alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否安好</span></p><p begin="02:06.265" end="02:08.490" itunes:key="L37">(Oh yeah)</p><p begin="02:08.500" end="02:11.455" itunes:key="L38">Just say you're all alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要说一声你一切安好</span></p><p begin="02:11.900" end="02:16.630" itunes:key="L39">(Yeah, oh, oh, yeah)</p><p begin="02:16.640" end="02:19.249" itunes:key="L40">'Cause I've been losing sleep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我总是辗转反侧 难以入眠</span></p><p begin="02:19.259" end="02:22.990" itunes:key="L41">Wondering if you're good, so please (So please)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知道你过得好不好 所以 拜托你</span></p><p begin="02:23.000" end="02:26.640" itunes:key="L42">Just pick your phone up, let me know and I'll stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 拜托你</span></p><p begin="02:26.650" end="02:30.635" itunes:key="L43">Are you alright? Just say you're all alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否安好</span></p><p begin="02:34.611" end="02:37.281" itunes:key="L44">Just say you're all alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要说一声你一切安好</span></p></div></body></tt>